            body="Ionar charges a player with energy, inflicting $52659s1 Nature damage to the charged player and their allies within $52659A1 yards every $52658t1 sec for $52658d. When Static Overload expires, it explodes for an additional $53337s1 Nature damage to all players within $53337A1 yards, knocking them back." },
