            body="Sparks of Ionar inflict $52671s1 Nature damage to nearby players, increasing the Nature damage they take by $52671s2% for $52671d. This effect stacks.\n\nArcing Burn leaps to nearby players, affecting up to $52671x1 players." },
        },
