      { id=640, name="Ingvar the Plunderer", order=3,
        uiMapID=135, x=0.724, y=0.3811, rootSection=7619,
        desc="Ingvar's brute strength is legendary even among the vrykul. Rumor has it that he once bested King Ymiron in a brawl. The truth is unknown, but purveyors of that tale usually don't live for a retelling. Ingvar has promised the Lich King that he'll use all measures of brutality to hold the keep, a promise that he dare not break.",
