            body="$bullet;Avoid damaging Runemaster Molgeim while he has |cFF2959D3|Hspell:62274|h[Shield of Runes]|h|r.\n$bullet;Standing in a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:64320|h[Rune of Power]|h|r will increase damage dealt.\n$bullet;Avoid Stormcaller Brundir to minimize damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:61869|h[Overload]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:61887|h[Lightning Tendrils]|h|r." },
