503,pct=20.0,q=4,diff=0,name="Metallic Loop of the Sufferer"}, {id=45038,pct=40.0,q=5,diff=0,name="Fragment of Val'anyr"}, {id=45087,pct=0,q=3,diff=0,name="Runed Orb"} },
        sections = {
          { id=17637, title="Overview", parent=0, child=17638, sib=17641, order=1, spell=0, icon=0, flags=0, cdisp=0,
            body="General Vezax inflicts all healers with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:62692|h[Aura of Despair]|h|r, removing all mana regeneration. Mana can be restored by utilizing the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:63338|h[Saronite Vapors ]|h|r that coalesce on the ground in the area." },
          { id=17638, title="Damage Dealers", parent=17637, child=0, sib=17639, order=2, spell=0, icon=0, flags=0, cdisp=0,
            body="$bullet;Interrupt |cFF2959D3|Hspell:62661|h[Searing Flames]|h|r to avoid heavy damage.\n$bullet;Avoid damaging allies while afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:63276|h[Mark of the Faceless]|h|r." },
          { id=17639, title="Healers", parent=17637, child=0, sib=17640, order=3, spell=0, icon=0, flags=0, cdisp=0,
            body="$bullet;Avoid damaging allies while afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:63276|h[Mark of the Faceless]|h|r.\n$bullet;Use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:63338|h[Saronite Vapors ]|h|r to regenerate Mana." },
          { id=17640, title="Tanks", parent=17637, child=0, sib=0, order=4, spell=0, icon=0, flags=0, cdisp=0,
            body="$bullet;Flee when Vezax gains |cFF2959D3|Hspell:62662|h[Surge of Darkness]|h|r to avoid heavy damage." },
